"descriptions are all identical to {en_listing} -- files that only repeat the "
"English catalog -- and offer to delete them. The Addon Manager falls back to "
"{en_listing} for any language without its own file. Files with any "
"translated name or description are kept, and no {po_dir} or {locale_dir} "
"translation files are touched."
msgstr ""

